description	"Imperial Anti-Air Unit

^2Weaponry:
- Blaster Pistol (3)
- PLX-1 Rocket Launcher (3 Rockets)
- 2 Pulse Grenades

^8Attributes:
- 1 Reinforcement

^3Abilities:
- Jetpack [Fuel 3]

The Anti-Air Units of the Imperial Navy are equipped with high quality Anti-Air Rocket Launchers that can be loaded with a Pulse tip for destruction of the enemy's flight equipment. Due to the heavy nature of their equipment, they are limited to only a side arm in addition to their Rocket Launchers."